The recursive invocation claim closed cleanly with exit 0 and `#Top`. The exact-module claim is taking materially longer when selected alone; I’m letting it finish rather than inferring success from the candidate’s combined run, and I’ll distinguish a genuine stuck proof from tool/runtime delay based on its actual residual and exit status.
